, "timestamp_created": 1638148409, "timestamp_updated": 1638148409, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104601689", "author": {"steamid": "76561198152405183", "personaname": "Drax", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198152405183/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1474, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 782, "last_played": 1683511075, "avatar": "13746581bbed72679492fbcf8ec216ae2353f9a0"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Los bots no son de mucha ayuda, no mejoran sus armas no escogen cartas de talentos y ni te ayudan a transportar objetos claves para la misión, pero si tienes 3 amigos que están dispuestos a pagar el juego y ayudarte a matar a bastardos descerebrados, este juego es lo que buscas.\nMi recomendación, comprarlo en descuento.", "timestamp_created": 1638129521, "timestamp_updated": 1638129521, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527248859405517578", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104462428", "author": {"steamid": "76561198356810057", "personaname": "Jeff", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Jeffrey23/", "num_games_owned": 169, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 22558, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1293, "last_played": 1679647798, "avatar": "26fdf4a2f757c04a3114ac1ddf9223e8b42f1d8e"}, "language": "latam", "review": "-Buenísimo para los amantes de l4d. Lo malo es que no hay balas, no hay